{"id": "unknown-2026-06-08-008", "date": "2026-06-08", "time_tags": {"year": 2026, "quarter": "Q2", "month": 6, "week": 24, "weekday": "Mon"}, "entities": {"companies": [], "customers": [], "suppliers": []}, "topics": ["supply_chain_shift"], "sentiment": {"label": "neutral", "score": 0.0, "keywords": []}, "importance": {"score": 0.5, "reasons": []}, "title": "Bangladesh to support revival of shuttered industries with $1.63 bn", "content": "Bangladesh Bank has launched a $1.63 billion pre-finance scheme to revive closed or sick large industrial and service-sector enterprises.\nCompanies with the technical skills, infrastructure, and commercial capacity to take over or lease a closed unit and restart operations will also receive priority.\nLoan defaulters, money launderers, fund diverters and fraudsters will be barred from the low-cost loans.", "sources": [{"name": "fibre2fashion_textile", "url": "https://www.fibre2fashion.com/news/textile-news/bangladesh-to-support-revival-of-shuttered-industries-with-1-63-bn-310847-newsdetails.htm", "type": "rss"}]}
{"id": "hm-2026-06-08-009", "date": "2026-06-08", "time_tags": {"year": 2026, "quarter": "Q2", "month": 6, "week": 24, "weekday": "Mon"}, "entities": {"companies": ["hm"], "customers": [], "suppliers": []}, "topics": ["supply_chain_shift"], "sentiment": {"label": "neutral", "score": 0.0, "keywords": []}, "importance": {"score": 0.5, "reasons": []}, "title": "Sweden’s H&M Foundation unveils 2026 Global Change Award winners", "content": "H&M Foundation’s Global Change Award 2026 recognises 10 innovators tackling fashion’s highest-emission areas through bio-based fibres, textile recycling, AI-driven efficiency and low-impact dyeing. \nWinners from India, the US, UK, Sweden, France, Tanzania and Bangladesh will each receive €200,000 and join a year-long programme supporting scalable climate solutions for a net-zero textile industry by 2050.", "sources": [{"name": "fibre2fashion_textile", "url": "https://www.fibre2fashion.com/news/textile-news/sweden-s-h-m-foundation-unveils-2026-global-change-award-winners-310846-newsdetails.htm", "type": "rss"}]}
{"id": "unknown-2026-06-08-010", "date": "2026-06-08", "time_tags": {"year": 2026, "quarter": "Q2", "month": 6, "week": 24, "weekday": "Mon"}, "entities": {"companies": [], "customers": [], "suppliers": []}, "topics": ["supply_chain_shift"], "sentiment": {"label": "neutral", "score": 0.0, "keywords": ["increase", "uncertainty"]}, "importance": {"score": 0.5, "reasons": []}, "title": "India’s polyester market sees mixed trend amid crude oil volatility", "content": "India’s polyester raw material market showed mixed trends this week as volatile crude oil prices, driven by Middle East war, influenced sentiment.\nPTA rose ₹3/kg and melt increased ₹2.58/kg, while MEG remained stable.\nPolyester yarn producers raised prices amid higher input costs, though downstream buyers continued cautious, need-based purchases amid uncertainty over feedstock and demand trends.", "sources": [{"name": "fibre2fashion_textile", "url": "https://www.fibre2fashion.com/news/textile-news/india-s-polyester-market-sees-mixed-trend-amid-crude-oil-volatility-310838-newsdetails.htm", "type": "rss"}]}
{"id": "unknown-2026-06-08-011", "date": "2026-06-08", "time_tags": {"year": 2026, "quarter": "Q2", "month": 6, "week": 24, "weekday": "Mon"}, "entities": {"companies": [], "customers": [], "suppliers": []}, "topics": ["earnings"], "sentiment": {"label": "neutral", "score": 0.0, "keywords": []}, "importance": {"score": 0.75, "reasons": ["涉及財報"]}, "title": "Australia to see cotton crop contract to 3 mn bales in 2026-27", "content": "With harvest completed in the north and nearing completion in the south, the 2025-26 production year for many Australian cotton growers has been a delicate balance of prioritising limited water supply and increasing costs, against what initially looked to be relatively low and flat price outlook, ANZ said.\nThe country may see a further contraction in cotton crop to 3 million bales for the 2026-27 season.", "sources": [{"name": "fibre2fashion_textile", "url": "https://www.fibre2fashion.com/news/textile-news/australia-to-see-cotton-crop-contract-to-3-mn-bales-in-2026-27-310835-newsdetails.htm", "type": "rss"}]}
{"id": "unknown-2026-06-08-012", "date": "2026-06-08", "time_tags": {"year": 2026, "quarter": "Q2", "month": 6, "week": 24, "weekday": "Mon"}, "entities": {"companies": [], "customers": [], "suppliers": []}, "topics": ["earnings"], "sentiment": {"label": "positive", "score": 0.5, "keywords": ["growth"]}, "importance": {"score": 0.75, "reasons": ["涉及財報"]}, "title": "Oil crisis hits world growth outlook as Fitch revises down forecasts", "content": "World growth prospects have been hurt by the oil crisis triggered by the Middle East conflict, Fitch Ratings said.\nIt lowered its 2026 forecast for global growth by 0.2 pp to 2.4 per cent.\nForecast cuts have been widespread as higher inflation squeezes real wages, dampens consumption and raises companies’ input costs.\nGrowth in emerging markets excluding China has been lowered by 0.2 pp to 3.2 per cent.", "sources": [{"name": "fibre2fashion_textile", "url": "https://www.fibre2fashion.com/news/textile-news/oil-crisis-hits-world-growth-outlook-as-fitch-revises-down-forecasts-310834-newsdetails.htm", "type": "rss"}]}
{"id": "unknown-2026-06-08-013", "date": "2026-06-08", "time_tags": {"year": 2026, "quarter": "Q2", "month": 6, "week": 24, "weekday": "Mon"}, "entities": {"companies": [], "customers": [], "suppliers": []}, "topics": ["supply_chain_shift"], "sentiment": {"label": "neutral", "score": 0.0, "keywords": ["growth", "[否定]expand"]}, "importance": {"score": 0.5, "reasons": []}, "title": "Vietnam, Canada to shift to more substantive phase of cooperation", "content": "Vietnam and Canada have agreed to focus on three priority areas and shift from the JEC mechanism to a more action-oriented and substantive cooperation phase.\nOne of the priority areas is diversifying trade and investment, making effective use of the CPTPP, supporting an open trading system and accelerating ASEAN-Canada FTA talks.\nAnother is expanding cooperation in energy, infrastructure and green growth.", "sources": [{"name": "fibre2fashion_textile", "url": "https://www.fibre2fashion.com/news/textile-news/vietnam-canada-to-shift-to-more-substantive-phase-of-cooperation-310833-newsdetails.htm", "type": "rss"}]}
